    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "drastic changes like what?? i dont think i have the power to change anything here. my whole life is built on these walls. every time i try to push back, it just feels like i'm hitting a brick wall. it feels like there's literally no version of my life where i actually get to breathe. i just wish i could just... stop. stop the noise, stop the pressure. i just want it to be quiet.",
